    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39898" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκροτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beaten</i> or <i>trodden
				hard</i>, esp. of ground, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ἐπικρότῳ ἱππεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					3.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					558a6
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ. τῶν λόγων</span>
			their <i>sonorousness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				1.25.7
			</span></i>.</div>
